    "answer": "The decision to use Postgres logical replication for the pilot cut-over should be revisited before the full cut-over, when the volume is twenty times the pilot. [D-1 Cut over the pilot with Postgres logical replication](/projects/2415ccf7-9c11-4023-b933-f5ab9db037d3/decisions?decision=ed772b25-a0de-45e6-b207-108169f39486) This decision was made on 2026-09-09. [D-1 Cut over the pilot with Postgres logical replication](/projects/2415ccf7-9c11-4023-b933-f5ab9db037d3/decisions?decision=ed772b25-a0de-45e6-b207-108169f39486) The alternative of application-layer dual-write was rejected due to the extensive work required and the unnecessary rollback benefit at pilot volume. [D-1 Cut over the pilot with Postgres logical replication](/projects/2415ccf7-9c11-4023-b933-f5ab9db037d3/decisions?decision=ed772b25-a0de-45e6-b207-108169f39486) The assumption is that rollback within two to four hours is acceptable at pilot volume. [D-1 Cut over the pilot with Postgres logical replication](/projects/2415ccf7-9c11-4023-b933-f5ab9db037d3/decisions?decision=ed772b25-a0de-45e6-b207-108169f39486)",
